Dear Light Chasers:
Since the official release of "Lumione", most players have encountered a few bugs and problems while enjoying the game. The project team has started the BUG repair work simultaneously. The following is the repair content of the related BUG:

1. Fixed the problem of "the character can stand on some thorns by mistake";
2. Modified the structure of some levels to optimize the game experience;
3. Fixed the problem of "The mobile platform in Chapter 1 will cause the character to pass through";
4. Improved the recognition of "the entrance that can be drilled into the ground in Chapter 3.

Dear Light Chasers:
After the official release of "Lumione" on October 13th, there were some problems in the game that affected everyone's gaming experience. Our team has been aware of and urgently fixed the following problems:
1. Fixed the problem of "the character can stand on certain error thorns ";
2. Fixed the problem of "characters in certain scenes can pass through thorns/air walls";
3. Fixed the problem of "the volume of the character collides with the thorns in some scenes";
4. Fixed the problem of "characters in certain scenes can be stuck in the door/wall";
5. Fixed the problem of "The character moves incorrectly when the character drills into the ground in Chapter 3";
6. Modified the structure of some levels to optimize the game experience.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38025095/5f2cae726e489c5582449876a00debcef7c5edde.png[/img]

Hello Light Seekers! 

Since the launch of the demo version of Lumione, the development team has been closely following user feedback on social media platforms. We have been overwhelmed by the words of encouragement we have received so far, and have collected a great deal of suggestions. Thank you from the bottom of our hearts for your continued support of our game.
In this latest update, we have fixed certain bugs in the demo version, and we’ve optimized the game’s performance. The official version of the game will also receive these same updates. We hope these changes will make for a more enjoyable playing experience, and we wish you endless fun in your adventures through Lumione’s deep-sea world. 


The Steam Celebration of Upcoming Games will begin on October 1st, 2021 at 10 AM PDT. This time, Lumione will also participate! If you’re curious about our game, there’s no better time to give the demo version a try!

As always, the Glimmer team would like to thank all Light Seekers, new and old, from the bottom of our hearts. It is your continued support that allows us to do what we do. Let us all continue on our own individual journeys in search of the light!


Updates:

Bug fixes:
1. Fixed the issue that the character can stand on some of the thorns;
2. Fixed the client crash and Fatal Error issue;
3. Fixed the issue that the character can pass through the air wall in certain scenes.

Game optimization:
1. The character will recover its flight count when passing the level boundary to reach the next/previous level;
2. Adjusted the length of time that the text appears in the prologue when the character gains new abilities;
3. Optimized the Control Prompts for character flying;
4. Optimized the operation feel of the interaction between the character and the wall;
5. Optimized the collision determination between the character and the thorns.

Game level update:
Modified the level structure of the last level in Chapter 2.
